msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rfd900.rst:22
#: 8deffc5f627341e1be40381d227a40f3
msgid "The hardware is closed source but the `software is open <https://github.com/RFDesign/SiK>`__ and is based on the same software that runs on the :ref:`SiK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` meaning configuration and setup is extremely similar and these radios can even be paired with a 900Mhz SiK radio (i.e. you may choose to use one RFD900 on the ground, and a SiK radio in the aircraft)."
msgstr ""

